---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <span class="badge">About Us</span>
      <h1 style="margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;">Whiskey Tortilla Foxtrot</h1>
      <p class="about__text">
        Whiskey Tortilla Foxtrot is a side project for <a
          href="https://tonycardone.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">this guy</a
        > who spends a lot of time doing sports stuff alongside software stuff.
      </p>
      <p class="about__text">
        The flagship app, SeenAt, lets you log jerseys you spot at live sporting events, either in
        person or from the comfort of the couch. It's a little more advanced than "did you see that
        dude with the cool jersey", since you can actually log it now.
      </p>
      <p class="about__text text-secondary">
        Or, if you're more of a big number sort of person, you can keep track of the number of times
        you see someone in a Lionel Messi Inter Miami kit. It's really up to you.
      </p>

      <div class="about__aside">
        <p class="about__aside-text">
          <strong>Whiskey Tortilla Foxtrot.</strong> Life would be better if we threw tortillas in there.
        </p>
        <p class="about__aside-sub text-secondary">
          Building cool sports apps on the side. Because while we can't all do it from 9-5, we sure
          can think all about it from 9-5.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about__text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .about__aside {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
  }
  .about__aside-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .about__aside-sub {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
